OL,3,GNEWSANew off-licence sparks drinking
OL,4,Afears for town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new off-licence has been approved to
OL,7,Fopen at a former print shop in
OL,8,FWolverhampton, despite fears it will
OL,9,Fworsen town's drinking problems.
OL,11,FPlanning permission has been granted to
OL,12,Fsell alcohol from the Daily Stop and
OL,13,FOff Licence on Mount Pleasant, in
OL,14,FBilston.
OL,16,FNeighbouring music venue Robin 2 said
OL,17,Fthe decision was a "bad look" and said
OL,18,Fit risked undermining the council's #20
OL,19,Fmillion investment in regenerating the
OL,20,Ftown.
